        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Hume Auctioneers - We Get The Pick Of The Crop\n\nThis beautiful 4-bedroom property is magnificently spacious and enjoys a private fully walled in site with excellent off street parking\n\nEnjoying a perfect location in a quiet part of Kilminchy Village and within walking distance of schools, shops, restaurants and Hospital the property is superbly located.\n\nThe garden is extra spacious and ideal for a growing family.\n\n\nOn the ground floor the sitting room is bright and spacious and enjoys a picture window and feature fireplace. \n\nThe kitchen dining room is massively spacious with ample circulation space, a designer kitchen and double patio doors to the garden.\n\nThere is a further room on the ground floor which could serve as a fourth bedroom, home office or playroom.\n\nThe three upstairs bedrooms are delightfully spacious with the master benefiting from a fully detailed ensuite. All the bedrooms have excellent wardrobe space.\n The master bathroom completes the first-floor accommodation.\n\n\nKilminchy Village is a most sought-after neighbourhood. Designed by internationally renowned architect Melville Dunbar. Kilminchy's design is based upon the highly regarded Essex town plan, which has been executed to a magnificent standard in this most convenient location and resemble the meandering streets of a small village or town.\n\nWithin the development is a neighbourhood centre to include, shops, restaurants, Pharmacy and a gastropub. The recreational amenities are excellent too and include natural lakes, a purpose-built basketball court and acres of green space.\n\nSchools, shops, leisure centre and the hospital are all within walking distance, whilst Portlaoise town centre and the M7 motorway are just a few minutes away by car.\n\nThere is a magnificent hourly Bus service to Dublin which stops at the entrance, every hour day and night.\n\nThe development has been prewired with fibre optic broadband cable and speeds of up to 1gb are available.\n\nHighspeed fibre broadband laid on\n\nViewing Of This Exceptional Home is Highly Recommended.\n"
